# Android release signing is configured only through process environment variables.
# Keep real keystore passwords out of files, shell history, CI logs, and Gradle arguments.
#
# Required environment variable names:
# WHEELMAKER_ANDROID_KEYSTORE          (absolute path to a JKS or PKCS12 file)
# WHEELMAKER_ANDROID_STORE_PASSWORD    (secret; set in the process environment)
# WHEELMAKER_ANDROID_KEY_ALIAS         (alias in that keystore)
# WHEELMAKER_ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD      (secret; set in the process environment)
